Package: fastsae
Type: Package
Title: Fast Implementation of Small Area Estimation Methods
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
      person("Ridson", "Al Farizal P", role = c("aut", "cre","cph"), email = "alfrzlp@gmail.com", comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-0617-0214")),
      person("Azka", "Ubaidillah", role = "aut", email = "azka@stis.ac.id", comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-3597-0459")) 
    )
Description: Provides highly efficient implementations of small area estimation (SAE)
    methods through C++ and RcppArmadillo. Currently supports Fay-Herriot
    area-level models with ML/REML estimation, including EBLUP computation,
    MSE estimation, and model diagnostics (AIC, BIC, log-likelihood).
    Designed for large-scale applications where standard R implementations
    fall short.
